msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "Guru"

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__curriculum_id
msgid ""
"The Character Curriculum Map this activity delivers on. Optional: an "
"activity may be designed independently of a formal map."
msgstr "Peta Kurikulum Karakter yang dilaksanakan melalui aktivitas ini. Opsional: aktivitas dapat dirancang terlepas dari peta formal."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__alignment_ids
msgid ""
"The RBT-DOK-SOLO alignment-gate lines (ICLAD Bab 8): for each objective, the "
"activity, planned evidence, success rubric, and feedback plan that keep "
"objective, activity, and evidence aligned."
msgstr "Baris gerbang keselarasan RBT-DOK-SOLO (ICLAD Bab 8): untuk setiap tujuan, aktivitas, bukti yang direncanakan, rubrik keberhasilan, dan rencana umpan balik yang menjaga tujuan, aktivitas, dan bukti tetap selaras."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__activity_dok
msgid ""
"The activity to be delivered for this line, described at its Depth of "
"Knowledge (the actual cognitive demand)."
msgstr "Aktivitas yang akan dilaksanakan untuk baris ini, dijelaskan pada Depth of Knowledge-nya (tuntutan kognitif sebenarnya)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__arena_id
msgid ""
"The arena/program (e.g. classroom, project, live-in) that hosts this "
"activity as a practice ground for the construct."
msgstr "Arena/program (mis. kelas, proyek, live-in) yang menjadi wadah aktivitas ini sebagai ajang latihan konstruk."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__indicator_id
msgid ""
"The behavioral indicator that this alignment line observes as evidence of "
"the construct."
msgstr "Indikator perilaku yang diamati baris keselarasan ini sebagai bukti konstruk."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__construct_id
msgid "The character construct this learning activity develops."
msgstr "Konstruk karakter yang dikembangkan aktivitas pembelajaran ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__activity_id
msgid "The character learning activity document this line belongs to."
msgstr "Dokumen aktivitas pembelajaran karakter tempat baris ini berada."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__method_id
msgid "The character-development method applied in this activity."
msgstr "Metode pengembangan karakter yang diterapkan dalam aktivitas ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__activity_construct_id
msgid ""
"The construct of the parent activity, used to restrict the indicator choices "
"on this line to that construct."
msgstr "Konstruk dari aktivitas induk, digunakan untuk membatasi pilihan indikator pada baris ini sesuai konstruk tersebut."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__date_end
msgid ""
"The date the delivered activity ends. Leave empty for a single-session "
"activity."
msgstr "Tanggal berakhirnya aktivitas yang dilaksanakan. Biarkan kosong untuk aktivitas satu sesi."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__date
msgid "The date this Character Learning Activity document was drawn up."
msgstr "Tanggal dokumen Aktivitas Pembelajaran Karakter ini disusun."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__planned_evidence
msgid ""
"The evidence the activity is planned to produce (work product, observation, "
"artifact) that shows the objective was met."
msgstr "Bukti yang direncanakan dihasilkan aktivitas (hasil karya, observasi, artefak) yang menunjukkan tujuan tercapai."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__grade_class_id
msgid "The homeroom class that carries out this learning activity."
msgstr "Kelas wali yang melaksanakan aktivitas pembelajaran ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__objective
msgid ""
"The learning objective for this activity, phrased on the Revised Bloom's "
"Taxonomy (ICLAD Bab 8)."
msgstr "Tujuan pembelajaran aktivitas ini, dirumuskan pada Taksonomi Bloom Revisi (ICLAD Bab 8)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__objective_rbt
msgid ""
"The learning objective for this line, phrased on the Revised Bloom's "
"Taxonomy (the intended thinking level)."
msgstr "Tujuan pembelajaran baris ini, dirumuskan pada Taksonomi Bloom Revisi (level berpikir yang dituju)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__subconstruct_id
msgid ""
"The specific sub-construct this activity targets, when the design is more "
"granular than the construct itself."
msgstr "Subkonstruk spesifik yang disasar aktivitas ini, bila rancangannya lebih rinci daripada konstruknya."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity_alignment__solo_rubric
msgid ""
"The success criteria / rubric phrased on the SOLO taxonomy used to judge the "
"quality of the evidence for this line."
msgstr "Kriteria keberhasilan/rubrik yang dirumuskan pada taksonomi SOLO untuk menilai kualitas bukti pada baris ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__solo_target
msgid ""
"The target Structure of the Observed Learning Outcome (SOLO taxonomy) that "
"the planned evidence should reach (ICLAD Bab 8)."
msgstr "Target Structure of the Observed Learning Outcome (taksonomi SOLO) yang harus dicapai bukti yang direncanakan (ICLAD Bab 8)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__teacher_id
msgid "The teacher who designs and facilitates this learning activity."
msgstr "Guru yang merancang dan memfasilitasi aktivitas pembelajaran ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign "
"number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' agar nomor dibuat otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"  Penetapan nomor manual dapat dilakukan pada status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Memasukkan Nomor Dokumen Manual' yang dapat menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_activity.field_school_character_activity__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "Jenis aktivitas pengecualian pada rekaman."

#. module: ssi_school_character_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ssi_school_character_activity.selection__school_character_activity__rbt_level__understand
msgid "Understand"
msgstr "Memahami"

